ell shooter\u201d<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br><br>\u201cWe see big potential in Luna Abyss, a bullet-hell FPS set in a space prison in which your movement skills will be put to an even bigger test than your shooting skills.\u201d<br>IGN<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933000/ss_bcd9fb4d562116ee1a09b896671a2ab111909196.1920x1080.jpg?t=1771525854","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933000/ss_bcd9fb4d562116ee1a09b896671a2ab111909196.600x338.jpg?t=1771525854"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933000/ss_a23bbca2170a9f041984eb88dbe6a4fd179bf1bb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1771525854","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933000/ss_a23bbca2170a9f041984eb88dbe6a4fd179bf1bb.600x338.jpg?t=1771525854"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933000/ss_260a8d1b6e873dcdf3a973913749b408d981e454.1920x1080.jpg?t=1771525854","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933000/ss_260a8d1b6e873dcdf3a973913749b408d981e454.600x338.jpg?t=1771525854"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933000/ss_80f68cebaeff75b7ef5b1e1eceb7cec4c75aebaf.1920x1080.jpg?t=1771525854","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933000/ss_80f68cebaeff75b7ef5b1e1eceb7cec4c75aebaf.600x338.jpg?t=1771525854"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933000/ss_598c637ce76e28253fc92455f3594314d4c9df71.1920x1080.jpg?t=1771525854","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933000/ss_598c637ce76e28253fc92455f3594314d4c9df71.600x338.jpg?t=1771525854"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app